media: i2c: add a SmartSens SC202CS driver

The SC202CS is a 2 MP sensor with a one-lane CSI-2 output; on the
Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 5G (sunstone) it is the second rear camera. One
mode: 1600x1200 at 30 fps from a 24 MHz clock, 720 Mbps.

The register table and the exposure (0x3e00, lines * 16), gain (0x3e09
coarse 2^n - 1, 0x3e07 fine 0x80..0xff) and frame length (0x320e)
registers are those of the MediaTek sc202cs_mipi_raw driver in
Motorola's kernel (GPL-2.0), mirrored and flipped as it sets them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

